# Repo-root .gitignore (soms/ and soms_mobile_app/ each have their own
# more specific ones already -- this one only covers things that land
# at the repo root itself).

# Output of scripts/safe-zip.ps1 -- never meant to be committed.
*.zip

# Safety net: this should always live at D:\soms-secrets\, a SIBLING of
# this repo, never inside it -- see scripts/setup-secrets.ps1. If it ever
# ends up nested in here by mistake (e.g. the script run from an
# unexpected working directory), this stops it from being committable.
/soms-secrets/
